OL,5,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,9,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,10,     Fsettle some scores. After bitter
OL,11,     Frebukes, the winner is announced.
OL,12,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FThis episode focuses on how people
OL,14,     Fdeal with physical and emotional
OL,15,     Fpain. Dad-of-four Simon hasn't
OL,16,     Featen for days after his partner
OL,17,     Fended their relationship.
